list.item:
Eden, Sir Anthony, British Secretary of State
                        for Foreign Affairs and Deputy Prime Minister to April 1955; Prime Minister,
                        April 1955–January 1957

person.note:
Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs to October 1955;
                    Deputy Chief of Mission at the Embassy in the United Kingdom from November 1955;
                    Minister–Counselor from February 1956

Special Assistant to the Secretary of State to December 1955; Deputy Assistant
                    Secretary of State for Congressional Relations, December 1955–May 1957;
                    thereafter Administrator, Bureau of Security and Consular Affairs
